label: Confirm Citations
description: Confirms a finding's citations, one hop behind the style check — which is what gives the join a window where a cross-revision pairing is actually available
input: FactFinding
output: FactReport
examples:
  - given:
      FactFinding:
        revision_id: "m-1-r1"
        claim: "claim at round 1"
    expect:
      FactReport:
        revision_id: "m-1-r1"
        note: "facts ok at round 1"
